y) (copy 2)_778841320224743439]&#13;&#10;WHEN &apos;To Customer Time&apos; THEN [Avg Travel Time (copy)_778841320225951763]&#13;&#10;WHEN &apos;Fleet Delay&apos; THEN [Avg Travel Time (copy)_778841320226263061]&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;END' />
