                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>Bin Threshold - % of Orders</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>: parameter to exclude bins with % of total orders smaller than the defined threshold. The objective is to clean the noise.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>E.g. if you define Bin Threshold - % of Orders = 0.1%, then the bins that has % of total orders smaller than that will not be shown in the graph. </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
