                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8'>* User Share is calculated on the test level for all the report dates regardless of any filters</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8'>* Adjusted Orders is calculated as Total Orders * Weight Factor, where</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8' italic='true'> Weight Factor = User Shares(Control) /  User Share (VariationX)</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='8'>** Time and distance Metrics are calculated for OD orders only</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
